{'name': {'value': 'In Your Corner', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'former_names': [{'value': 'Pretty Padded Room', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}], 'website': {'value': 'http://inyourcorneronline.com', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'New York, NY, USA', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': 'In Your Corner is a marketplace for online counseling and coaching services. Through a secure, HIPAA-compliant platform, our service connects users with a carefully curated team of wellness professionals. By conducting online consultations via video chat, written journals, and even texting sessions, we have transformed traditional therapy into an experience that is low-cost, convenient, and completely confidential.

Everyone can benefit from an objective perspective during difficult times, but the current model for supportive services is broken due to insurance gridlock, a clunky referral system, long wait times and unsustainable costs. Our web-based approach offers valuable guidance through accessible and anonymous means. Users log in to secure accounts and speak with licensed professionals on a variety of topics—relationship conflict, job stress, etc.—from anywhere at any time. With our proprietary technology, we have removed every barrier to entry and created an outlet for millions who wouldn’t have sought emotional health services otherwise, reducing stress for an increasingly stressed-out generation. This is the future of mental health. 

The shift in moving counseling services online is inevitable and our product is already in demand: After a successful pilot with Pretty Padded Room, an online therapy website specifically targeted towards millennial women, we are excited to relaunch as In Your Corner, an aspirational brand that provides the very best in counseling, coaching, and calm. In Your Corner improves on our original offering by being more gender-inclusive and convenient. In addition to developing a mobile app to provide one-tap, on-demand support in real time, users also have access not only to licensed mental health counselors, but also coaches in personal and professional development as well as instructors of meditation and breath work.', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': "We've transformed traditional therapy into an experience that is…", 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Mental Health Tech', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Telehealth', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Digital Health', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

{'name': {'value': 'Nightingale', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'website': {'value': 'http://nightingaleapp.com', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'San Francisco, CA, USA', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': "Nightingale is the clinical decision support solution for evidence-based interventions. We're committed to ensuring that service providers for individuals with autism and related disorders are equipped to administer high quality, personalized treatment.

According to the CDC, 1 in 68 children in the U.S. are now diagnosed with autism, contributing to an estimated 1.5 million Americans living with the condition. Although autism has no known cure or scientifically proven pharmaceutical treatment, its symptoms can be abated and maintained through rigorous evidence-based interventions like applied behavior analysis, speech-language pathology, and occupational therapy. 

Nightingale provides these practitioners with a suite of tools for HIPAA-compliant data collection,reporting, and analytics that can be customized to any curriculum and used in any setting. By equipping service providers with a convenient and user-friendly solution for data management and analytics, Nightingale frees up more of their time for creating high-quality curriculums and working with clients.", 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'App for managing care of autistic students', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Education', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Health Tech', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

{'name': {'value': 'VizeraLabs', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'website': {'value': 'http://vizeralabs.com', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'Sunnyvale, CA, USA', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': 'Vizera was an augmented reality company that used projectors with depth sensors to project an AR layer onto real world objects, rather than using screens/smart glasses. 

Our first application was in retail where we partnered with top furniture retailers to display their selection of different fabrics/patterns by using our projectors in their smaller showrooms to improve their in store revenue. 

Our demo is still live on YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5YV8lo-OxZQ ', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'Augmented reality through projectors', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Augmented Reality', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Computer Vision', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

{'name': {'value': 'TAXA Biotechnologies', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'former_names': [{'value': 'Glowing Plant', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}], 'website': {'value': 'http://www.taxa.com', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'San Francisco, CA, USA', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': 'The TAXA platform has been specifically designed to enable anyone to perform metabolic engineering of plants without stepping into a lab. We provide access to protein engineering, DNA assembly, transient experiments and stable transformation as a service. The best thing is that anything "Powered by TAXA" is designed to be free from expensive regulatory approval, meaning the products are available for sale or distribution to consumers in the United States immediately after they are developed. For a detailed list of the experiments which can be run on our platform please see the Services page.

Our vision is a world where bio-engineering is as easy and commonplace as mobile application development is today. Game-changing technologies, like genetic engineering, should not be the exclusive preserve of large corporations and a wealthy elite. Democratizing the tools of creation enables anyone, anywhere, to genetically engineer plants and will unleash a wave of creativity to power an environment where ultimately what we create is limited only by our imagination.  The TAXA platform is our next step in the realization of that dream

We are also the team behind the first synthetic biology crowdfunding project, raising $484k on Kickstarter to make real glowing plants: www.glowingplant.com', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'We enable cheaper, faster, and better genetic engineering of plants.…', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Agriculture', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Genetic Engineering', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Biotechnology', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

{'name': {'value': 'Human Interest', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'former_names': [{'value': 'Captain401', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Human Interest (Captain401)', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}], 'website': {'value': 'http://humaninterest.com', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'San Francisco, CA, USA; Remote', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': 'Human Interest is on a mission to ensure that people in all lines of work have access to retirement benefits. 

Nearly half of all working Americans are not saving enough for their future. Too often it’s because they are employed by a company that doesn’t offer a retirement plan. Human Interest is changing that by making it affordable and accessible for small and medium-sized businesses to offer employees a path to financial independence through retirement savings.

