{'name': {'value': 'Seneca Systems', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'website': {'value': 'https://www.senecagov.com', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'Redwood City, CA, USA', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': 'Every day, incredible government workers serve the public without the resources—and appreciation—their important work deserves. These hard-working teams have to deal with communications arriving from too many channels, maze-like processes for fulfilling constituent requests, and a dangerous lack of visibility into constituent opinions on major issues and the work teams perform.   

