{'name': {'value': 'LAIKA', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'website': {'value': 'https://laika.com.co/', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'Bogotá, Bogota, Colombia', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': 'The top of mind for pets, the “one-stop shop” market in LATAM. A pet ecosystem that combines On and offline platform where pet owners will find a solution for all their needs, including products & services. 
Currently, to meet the needs of their pets, people must go to different places and platforms. To find products, they go to one place; for services, they go to several others; and for healthcare, a few more. In Colombia, in average, a person must visit or consult more than seven places per year to meet the needs of their pets.

We built a digital platform where users don’t have to go anywhere else to meet said needs. With two main sections; products and services. In the products section, we have more than 4,000 references (among which you can find most of the brands of food, snacks, medicines, accessories and others). In the services section, we have more than 17 services, all the healthcare, beauty and entertainment services. All of the above delivered straight to your home and with the flexibility of choosing the date and time on and at which you wish to receive the order, including same-day deliveries for the main cities and accepting all payment methods, both online and cash on delivery.', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'Online pets supplies for Latin America with over 4000 products & 20…', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Marketplace', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

{'name': {'value': 'Vorticity', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'former_names': [{'value': 'Nabla Computing', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Nabla Inc', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}], 'website': {'value': 'http://vorticity.xyz/', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'Redwood City, CA, USA', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': "Many pressing problems facing humanity can be solved with faster scientific compute. Currently, it takes billions of dollars to design and develop a new fusion reactor, a hyper-sonic airplane or a new cancer treatment. This is because scientists and engineers have to build very expensive things before they even know if their ideas work. But what if we can simulate the workings of these ideas (and more) on computers first and have high confidence that it works before we build really expensive things?

The work of humanity's greatest scientists over the years has given us the physics and math to do this. The problem is that we simply do not have the computing power to solve these big problems.

To address this, the Vorticity Inc is re-imagining scientific computing all the way down to processor architecture and system design. Our proven technology is already helping the energy, life sciences and aerospace industries.", 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'The Fastest Scientific Computing Platform on the Planet', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Cloud Computing', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

{'name': {'value': 'Deepnote', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'website': {'value': 'https://www.deepnote.com/', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': '', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': 'Data science is as much a scientific and creative process as it is an engineering one. It involves working together, failing, learning and going back to the drawing board. Data scientists are explorers. To make data projects successful, we need tools that are both powerful and easy to use. Tools that help us collaborate and share our work in an engaging way. Tools that make data science fun again.

At Deepnote, we’re building a new standard in data tooling — a notebook that brings teams together to explore, analyze and present data from start to finish.

We are building tools for explorers. Join us.', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'A better data science notebook.', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Developer Tools', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Machine Learning', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

{'name': {'value': 'PayMongo', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'former_names': [{'value': 'Equiac', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}], 'website': {'value': 'https://paymongo.com', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'Taguig, NCR, Philippines', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': 'PayMongo builds products and tools that enable thousands of individuals and businesses in the Philippines to make and receive payments over the Internet. We support payments through credit or debit cards, electronic wallets, over-the-counter payments and many more.

We build robust APIs, plugins and other products that abstract out the complexities of payments from our users so they can get up and running quickly and focus on their business.

Our investors include Founders Fund, Peter Thiel, Bedrock Capital and Stripe.', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'Modern online payments for the Philippines', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Fintech', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

{'name': {'value': 'Recidiviz', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'website': {'value': 'https://www.recidiviz.org/', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'New York, NY, USA', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': 'Recidiviz is a non-profit technology company that drives meaningful changes in criminal justice systems and improved outcomes for justice-impacted individuals.

Criminal justice data today is inefficient and ineffective: researchers, advocates, policymakers and practitioners each need funding and time for data collection and cleaning (for almost any data at all), and most data collected is too stale by the time it’s compiled to be useful.

Recidiviz has built an open-source platform to ingest data from across data silos, link it, standardize it, and expose it in usable formats to the ecosystem. We provide products and analyses on top of this platform to help government agencies understand how their justice systems are functioning, set and track progress towards goals, drive evidence-based improvements to practice and policy, and ensure justice-impacted folks reenter their communities as safely and quickly as they can.', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'Helping create a smaller, fairer, safer justice system', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Civic Tech', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'GovTech', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Nonprofit', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

{'name': {'value': 'spotLESS Materials', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'website': {'value': 'https://www.industry.spotlessmaterials.com', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'State College, PA, USA', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': 'Surface fouling is a costly challenge across industries, impacting medical consumables, diagnostic devices, and automotive components. Contamination from substances like mud, ice, and sludge can compromise performance and lead to frequent cleaning, repairs, and replacements.

Our PFAS-free coating, which we first launched as a consumer product, has quickly expanded into industrial partnerships. It dramatically reduces contamination on critical surfaces such as glass, metal, ceramic, and now plastics too. Whether for medical devices or automotive components, our coating protects against surface fouling
Currently our coatings work best on glass, metal, and ceramic surfaces. ', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'Repellent coatings without PFAS', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Hard Tech', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Nanotechnology', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Advanced Materials', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

{'name': {'value': 'Embrace', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'website': {'value': 'https://embrace.io', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'Los Angeles, CA, USA; Remote', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': '*S19 and YCG F21*
Engineering teams shouldn’t be in the dark when it comes to the performance of their mobile apps and user experiences. With our industry-leading mobile observability technology, Embrace aims to give SRE and DevOps teams better insight into what matters most – their users – by tying mobile performance data to backend observability insights.

As the only user-focused, mobile-first observability solution built on OpenTelemetry, Embrace delivers crucial insights across both DevOps and mobile teams to illuminate real customer impact – not just server impact – to deliver the best app experiences. Customers like The New York Times, Marriott, Warby Parker, Masterclass, Home Depot, and Cameo love Embrace’s mobile observability platform because it makes extremely complicated and voluminous data actionable.', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'Modern mobile observability built on OpenTelemetry', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Developer Tools', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'SaaS', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Open Source', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

{'name': {'value': 'AudioFocus', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'website': {'value': 'http://audiofocus.io', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'Oakland, CA, USA', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': "If we've learned anything in the last few years it's that spending time with our friends and family is essential to our well-being and happiness. Unfortunately, loud and noisy places like weddings and family gatherings hinder human connection, especially for the hearing impaired. In fact, the biggest unmet need in the entire hearing healthcare industry is hearing in noisy places. AudioFocus helps patients hear in these environments by only enhancing voices nearby the patients and ignoring ones farther away. We do this using acoustics informed machine learning and custom microphone array design.

Our goal is to increase the adoption rate of 37M US adults with hearing loss, only 8M use hearing aids today.

Founded by Auditory Neuroscientist & AI expert and a Hearing Aid hardware design expert.", 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'Hearing aids that work in noisy places, like restaurants, using ML.', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Deep Learning', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Hardware', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Medical Devices', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

{'name': {'value': 'Lucid Bots', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'former_names': [{'value': 'Lucid Drone Technologies', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Lucid Drone Tech', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}], 'website': {'value': 'https://lucidbots.com/', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'Charlotte, NC, USA', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': 'At Lucid, we are a B2B robotics provider for dull, dirty, and dangerous jobs, starting with the cleaning industry, which has a 200% annual turnover rate. 

Our primary product is a drone that can clean anything from windows to roofs to stadium domes to industrial tanks. Our drones can clean up to 8x faster. Due to customer demand, we also launched a ground-based pressure-washing robot to complement our cleaning drone.

We support customers around the country who use our robots every day to clean properties with great safety and efficiency. We engineer, manufacture, and support our technology from a 20,000 sqft headquarters in Charlotte, NC.', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'We build robots for dull, dirty, and dangerous jobs.', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Robotics', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Drones', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Manufacturing', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Aerospace', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Self-Driving Vehicles', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

{'name': {'value': 'Plotdrive', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'former_names': [{'value': 'Figments', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Wordloops', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Heroic Story', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}], 'website': {'value': 'https://plotdrive.com', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'Los Angeles, CA, USA', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': 'Plotdrive is the first continuous production system for narrative — infrastructure that transforms how long-form stories move from imagination to completion. Most books don’t fail for lack of talent; they fail when the workflow collapses somewhere between page 80 and page 300.

Founded by brothers with backgrounds in high-stakes poker, VR, and narrative systems, we built what we couldn’t find: an engine that holds the entire shape of a story while authors work inside it. Writers see 5-10× gains in throughput without losing their voice. Manuscripts that sat untouched for years finally reach the finish line. Authors are using Plotdrive to break decade-long blocks. Publishers are using it to rethink how story pipelines should operate when continuity, context, and editorial craft can finally scale.

The printing press made distribution industrial. We’re making completion industrial — creating the foundational layer for how narrative gets made at scale.', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'AI that remembers your book and helps you finish it', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Artificial Intelligence', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Entertainment', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Media', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Creator Economy', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'AI Assistant', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

