{'name': {'value': 'Pippin / Rent the Backyard', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'former_names': [{'value': 'Pippin', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'HelloPippin', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Rent The Backyard', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Rent the Backyard', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Pippin xyz / Rent the Backyard', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}], 'website': {'value': 'http://rentthebackyard.com', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'Oakland, CA, USA', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': 'Pippin is building the autonomous homebuilding factory for the $1.7 trillion housing crisis. 

Building a home requires human labor to: measure, cut, lift, drill, paint, and attach. This labor is used for a building’s: structure, vapor barriers, windows, insulation, siding, roofing, electrical, plumbing, fixtures, appliances, and cabinetry. The construction industry solves this complex variety of tasks by dividing them among tiny companies of specialized artisans. Few lessons learned are shared and the industry has had no growth in labor productivity since 1947.

Building technology, methods, and materials have advanced and the constraints limiting home manufacturing can now be removed. Regulations have changed to allow small and simple accessory dwelling units (a.k.a. ADUs or backyard homes), making it easier to mass-produce housing. Pippin started in the ADU market with its brand "Rent the Backyard" and will build duplexes, quadplexes, and eventually large apartment buildings.', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'Autonomous homebuilding factory for the $1.7 trillion housing crisis.', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Construction', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Housing', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Proptech', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

{'name': {'value': 'Hubla', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'former_names': [{'value': 'ChatPay', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}], 'website': {'value': 'https://hub.la', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'MG, Brazil', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': 'Hubla is the Shopify for creators, enabling anyone to build, manage, and grow their online business. We provide powerful tools to create courses, communities, sell products, manage memberships, and deliver content—all in one platform. For example, a fitness coach can charge her audience for a unique digital weight-loss program, turning passion into profit.

Creators need simple, flexible tools to succeed. Hubla’s fully customizable platform lets them own their strategy, stand out from competitors, and create unique experiences. This approach works—our top creator earns over $8M annually.

