{'name': {'value': 'Cambio', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'website': {'value': 'https://www.cambio.ai/', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'San Francisco, CA, USA', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': "Cambio is the AI-native commercial real estate operations platform, built by investors for investors. Our suite of products automatically collects building data to empower mission critical workflows like capital planning and compliance.

Cambio uses LLMs and agentic AI to reason across thousands of pages of unstructured data, run multi-stepanalyses, and continuously adapt as regulations, assets and market conditions change. With Cambio, investors can evaluate and prioritize retrofit investment opportunities across thousands of buildings at once, compressing months of work into minutes.

