We know this problem personally. Before Elevate, Scott was a Vice President at a $15B private equity firm where he was leading a roll-up. Steve and Jeff are both software engineers with backgrounds across finance, big tech, and start-ups. The founding team has been friends for over a decade from their Duke undergraduate days. ', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'Automated AI data integrations for roll-ups', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'AIOps', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Artificial Intelligence', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Finance', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'B2B', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Automation', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

