Users of Voxli can voice chat with up to 200 people at a time without leaving the browser or setting up a voice server. Each group voice chat exists at a persistent URL, which can be shared with friends via email or IM. Voxli works on Windows and Mac, and supports push-to-talk (walkie talkie) functionality outside of the browser.

Voxli is currently free while it is in open beta.', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': '', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}}

{'name': {'value': 'Bitplay', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'website': {'value': 'http://meetings.io', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'San Francisco, CA, USA', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': "With Meetings.io you can meet face to face with anyone from around the world within your web browser. Meet with a client, a customer, your project team or your co-workers in person without ever leaving your desk by simply creating a tiny meeting room link and sharing the link with anyone you want to meet with.

You can re-use your meeting room as many times as you want and you can have people drop in and out of the your room anytime. Because there's no sign ups or user registration needed to drop into a meeting room you can use Meetings.io as an online hangout for real time in person hangouts or as a telepresence system to attend meetings remotely.", 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'Effortless Video Meetings
