We own our tech from online ordering, to manage and dispatch orders to drivers, and build customer relationship. 

We're used by top companies in the biggest cities in the US and we help for our customers with any needs from breakfast, lunch, happy hour and dinner. We are known for our flexibility, reliability and provide recurring and last-minute catering orders. ", 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'MobyDish, a tech-enabled service, allowing anyone to place a catering…', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Food Service Robots & Machines', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Food Tech', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

