{'name': {'value': 'Pigeonly', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'website': {'value': 'http://pigeonly.com', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'Las Vegas, NV, USA', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': "Pigeonly is a subscription-based platform that makes it easy for people to search, find, and communicate with an incarcerated loved from anywhere in the world.  Our technology cuts the cost of expensive prison calls by 80% and allows our customers to send their inmate printed photos, greeting cards, and more right from any cell phone, tablet, or computer. 

