Renters on REZI are then able to find, tour, apply for, and lease their next home without any fees and in as little as five minutes — right from their phone — through pre-screened listings, contactless tours, and automated application decisions.', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'Rent Better', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Real Estate', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Proptech', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

{'name': {'value': 'MDalgorithms Inc.', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'former_names': [{'value': 'MDAlgorithms', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'MDAlgorithms Inc.', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'MDacne', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}], 'website': {'value': 'https://www.mdalgorithms.com', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'San Francisco, CA, USA; Remote', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': 'MDalgorithms is revolutionizing dermatology by delivering convenient, effective AI-powered solutions for skin and hair care. Since pioneering machine-learning models for acne treatment in 2017, we’ve advanced to develop the world’s first AI-powered scalp analysis for hair regrowth.

Our proprietary AI technology, built entirely in-house, analyzes blemishes, lesions, and hair conditions with unmatched precision, utilizing the largest global dataset of acne and scalp images. Clinically validated and tested by dermatologists, our personalized treatment kits—MDacne for acne and MDhair for hair regrowth—are customized to each individual’s unique needs, combining over 100 medical and botanical ingredients for optimal results.

