{'name': {'value': 'Jet Admin', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'website': {'value': 'https://jetadmin.io', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'San Francisco, CA, USA', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': 'Jet Admin - an app builder designed specifically for creating internal tools, admin panels, external portals, inventory apps, and other business applications really fast and without coding. 

In Jet Admin, you can assemble multi-page apps with complex user flows, connected to multiple data sources. Setting up custom layouts, adding custom actions and workflows, binding and transforming dynamic values, using conditional rules and validations - all is done through a drag & drop and point & click visual builder.

