{'name': {'value': 'Veera Health', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'website': {'value': 'https://www.veerahealth.com', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'MH, India', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': 'Veera Health is helping 110M women in India get treated for Polycystic Ovary Syndrome (PCOS).  Our app combines evidence-backed therapy with coaching & specialist support for a subscription fee.

PCOS is the most common cause of infertility in women, and can lead to diabetes, depression and cancer. Patients spend up to 10 years and thousands of rupees searching for the right treatment, yet 90% are dissatisfied with existing options. With our program, 85% patients report feeling "in control" of their PCOS after just 1 month and are 4-times more likely to complete treatment.

