Since launching, Onlook hit #1 on Hacker News, was the #1 trending repo on GitHub—above DeepSeek—and has earned over 8,500 GitHub stars.

Founded by Daniel Farrell, a designer of 10+ years and former Head of Growth, and Kiet Ho, an ex-Amazon and ex-ServiceNow engineer, Onlook is on a mission to finally solve the gap between design and development. ', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'Cursor for Designers', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Artificial Intelligence', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Developer Tools', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Design', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Design Tools', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

{'name': {'value': 'GrazeMate', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'website': {'value': 'https://grazemate.com', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': 'Sydney, NSW, Australia', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': "GrazeMate builds autonomous drones that herd cattle.

On command, our drones fly to a paddock, position themselves around the mob, and move them where they need to go. What used to take a full day of helicopters, motorbikes, and horses now runs on a schedule.

We work with some of the largest cattle ranches in the world. While the drones are herding, they're also estimating animal weights, measuring grass biomass, monitoring water levels, and flagging sick animals. We're building physical AI that lets a grazier manage thousands of head across millions of acres from their phone.", 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'Robot Cowboys that Herd Cattle with AI Drones', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'tags': [{'value': 'Reinforcement Learning', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Drones', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Computer Vision', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Agriculture', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}]}

{'name': {'value': 'Pollinate', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'former_names': [{'value': 'Polinate', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}], 'website': {'value': 'https://www.pollinate.tech/', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': '', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': "Supply chains still run on spreadsheets and inboxes because ERPs are rigid and the data is messy. We're solving this problem by building an ontology where agents can operate and provide outcomes for our customers.

We start with procurement, by automating three-way match: extracting supplier invoices from email and matching them to the correct PO and receipt across ERPs.

Learn more at pollinate.tech", 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'AI Agents for the supply chain.', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}}

{'name': {'value': 'Vela', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'website': {'value': 'https://tryvela.ai', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': '', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': "We are building Vela, the AI scheduling assistant for the most complex interactions. Everyone assumes scheduling is a calendaring problem. It's not. It's a human nuance problem: knowing who to prioritize, how hard to push, and which dynamics to navigate. Vela understands these nuances, and every interaction deepens that understanding.

Instead of manually calling, texting, and emailing hundreds of candidates across spreadsheets, today teams connect their system of record to Vela and it handles outreach, scheduling, and confirmation automatically with the nuances of industries and teams built in.

Gobhanu and Saatvik are brothers who scaled a microfinance bank to 77 countries as kids. We previously built at AWS ML + SuperCompute and BCG AI.", 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'one_liner': {'value': 'AI Agents For Complex Scheduling Coordination', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}}

{'name': {'value': 'Talking Computers', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'former_names': [{'value': 'Standard Agent Labs', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Analytical Engine', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Speedtrain', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, {'value': 'Also', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}], 'website': {'value': 'https://talkingcomputers.ai', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'all_locations': {'value': '', 'matchLevel': 'none', 'matchedWords': []}, 'long_description': {'value': "We deploy fleets of AI Infrastructure Engineers to collaborate over week-long time horizons, run 100s of experiments in parallel, and learn from them to optimize your training/ inference infrastructure to your workloads.

We've partnered with companies to speed up their GPU kernels to 6x SOTA, and improved the latency of voice models to twice the competition.
